sequenceDiagram
  %% status: draft
  %% kind: pipeline.capacity
  autonumber
  participant T as Task<br/>prep · build
  participant TP as Task pool<br/>beast 2 · shark 2
  participant PR as Pull request
  participant Q as CI queue<br/>FIFO
  participant CP as CI pool<br/>2 per host
  participant VM as Proof VMs
  T->>TP: Claim a task place<br/>wait when full
  TP-->>T: Fresh task VM<br/>from the base
  opt no Operation on the group for 30 minutes
    T->>PR: Save the workspace<br/>task-<id>-idle branch
    T->>TP: Delete the idle task VM<br/>after the save passed
  end
  T->>PR: Publish the PR
  T->>TP: Delete the task VM
  Note over T,TP: Later work claims again<br/>base + task branch or save
  PR->>Q: Prove the PR head
  Q->>CP: Take every free place<br/>at least 1 · up to batches
  CP-->>VM: Fresh VMs<br/>from the base
  Q->>VM: Split whole batches<br/>balance by measured time
  VM->>VM: Restore each fleet<br/>run its cases
  VM-->>Q: Verdict per case
  Q->>CP: Delete the proof VMs
  Q-->>PR: One merged report
  Note over Q,PR: Full pools wait<br/>two-hour budget
